@startuml architecture_view
title Architecture view — Runtime & deployment (DevOps)\nSistema Gestione Segnalazioni Comunali (GR10)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

legend left
  Stakeholder: DevOps engineer — deploy/configure in a new environment
  Evidence: pom.xml, persistence.xml, README.md, Database/*, Boundary/GUIHomePage, Entity facades
endlegend

node "Execution host (desktop JVM)" as Host {
  artifact "Maven artifact\nProgetto_Ing_Software_GR10:1.0-SNAPSHOT\n(Java 23)" as AppJar

  package "Application runtime (same JVM process)" as App {
    [Boundary\nSwing GUI\n(GUIHomePage entry)] as Boundary
    [Control\ncontrollers] as Control
    [Entity facades\nServizioUtenti /\nServizioSegnalazioni] as Entity
    [Database\nServizioPersistenza +\nJpaUtil] as Database
  }

  package "Runtime libraries (Maven deps)" as Libs {
    [Hibernate ORM\nhibernate-core 6.6.50\nJPA provider] as Hibernate
    [MySQL Connector/J\nmysql-connector-j 9.4.0\ncom.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver] as Connector
    [IntelliJ forms_rt 7.0.3\nSwing GUI Designer] as Forms
  }

  artifact "Config artifact\nMETA-INF/persistence.xml\nPU: Sistema_Gestione_Segnalazioni_Comunali\nRESOURCE_LOCAL" as PersistCfg
}

node "MySQL server (data store)" as MySQLHost {
  database "MySQL RDBMS\nport 3306" as MySQL {
    folder "segnalazioni_db" as DB {
      card "Mapped entities\n(Utente, Cittadino,\nOperatoreComunale,\nSegnalazione, NotaInterna,\nAggiornamentoStato, Notifica)\nhbm2ddl.auto=update" as Tables
    }
  }
}

' In-process call chain (BCED)
Boundary --> Control : UI events / simple maps
Control --> Entity : business delegation
Entity --> Database : ServizioPersistenza API
Database --> Hibernate : EntityManager / JPQL
Hibernate --> Connector : JDBC API
Forms ..> Boundary : GUI form runtime
PersistCfg ..> Database : EMF bootstrap\n(JpaUtil)
AppJar ..> App : runs on JVM 23

' Cross-process app ↔ database
Connector -[#blue]-> MySQL : JDBC\njdbc:mysql://127.0.0.1:3306/segnalazioni_db\nuser: segnalazioni_user

note right of PersistCfg
  Deploy-time config (persistence.xml):
  - jakarta.persistence.jdbc.driver
  - jdbc.url / user / password
  - hibernate.hbm2ddl.auto=update
  Align with MySQL DB + grants
  (see README setup steps)
end note

note bottom of MySQLHost
  Data is stored here.
  Application executes on the desktop JVM host;
  default shipped config targets localhost MySQL.
end note

@enduml
